Package: com.example.remotecontroller
Name: Remote Controller - Receiver
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 13.0)
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: System-wide virtual game controller that receives input from another iPhone over Wi-Fi. Allows native games like Stardew Valley to be controlled by iPhone A as a physical controller.
Maintainer: Example <example@example.com>
Author: Example
Section: Tweaks
Tag: purpose::game

